{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f The truth behind a chain of mysterious cases awaits your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the edge between dreams and reality, you will step into the role of an investigator, drawn into a series of puzzling and interwoven cases. From bizarre murders in nightmares to disappearances and crimes surfacing in reality, every clue hides a deeper secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Detective Experience:</strong><br>Case files, suspect photos, and crime scenes are all pieced together by your own hands. Every detail may lead to a breakthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected Cases:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Nightmare Murder Case</i>: Is the suspect from the dream connected to reality?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Wen Kai Affair</i>: A seemingly ordinary commission conceals a larger mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Wen Wan Murder</i>: The truth behind a missing girl\u2014who is pulling the strings?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Scene Exploration:</strong><br>Secret meetings in caf\u00e9s, mysterious bodies under artificial rocks, and hidden hospital records\u2014each step of the investigation brings you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Character Network:</strong><br>Zhang Meiqi, Lu Yunyun, Liu Gangqiang\u2026 Are they just ordinary people, or the key to uncovering the truth? Only careful observation can expose their disguises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles and Deduction:</strong><br>Use photos, notebooks, medical files, locker codes, and more to reconstruct the killer\u2019s motives and identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you untangle these cases and uncover the one true answer?<br>Every deduction tests your logic and observation skills. The truth belongs only to the sharpest detectives.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u771f\u76f8\u5e8f\u7ae0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962160/54181088f25599343ef64ef5f6f89edd67cd563f.jpg"},{"name":"\u86db\u7f51\u521d\u73b0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962160/72ad68a578bdb6a97f865d49cc5253bec1fb9427.jpg"},{"name":"\u6697\u4e2d\u503e\u542c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962160/4e6421e16bee701c0995430d2f2d98d6697b8b39.jpg"},{"name":"\u9762\u5177\u4e4b\u4e0b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962160/022881944bca8fb70aa7b55647695d99cd23ebe8.jpg"},{"name":"\u8db3\u8ff9\u8ffd\u8e2a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962160/e195923fba315d765968ad54f580233b7bf0feca.jpg"},{"name":"\u8ff7\u5bab\u6df1\u5904","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962160/ede15094bbe319e1f67ded6bc0c12810ff5611aa.jpg"},{"name":"\u52a0\u5bc6\u6863\u6848","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962160/ee932bb622fc3f25d901d06c594082515288e7ab.jpg"},{"name":"\u771f\u76f8\u9f7f\u8f6e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962160/008f2e74db97c458aeed8f554159bc4be4fc7163.jpg"},{"name":"\u70db\u5f71\u91cd\u91cd","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962160/fd9809a723a132df7ebd2d83910f62157ca73355.jpg"},{"name":"\u7ec8\u6781\u88c1\u51b3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962160/0faa82510817c25779ca0c1e99b7e6d6aeb89a3b.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962160?t=1759979583","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962160/052d1470c3ff3e240689