 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Character Network:</strong><br>Zhang Meiqi, Lu Yunyun, Liu Gangqiang\u2026 Are they just ordinary people, or the key to uncovering the truth? Only careful observation can expose their disguises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles and Deduction:</strong><br>Use photos, notebooks, medical files, locker codes, and more to reconstruct the killer\u2019s motives and identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you untangle these cases and uncover the one true answer?<br>Every deduction tests your logic and observation skills. The truth belongs only to the sharpest detectives.</p>","developers":["Quiet Loop Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962160/8b511aef13acefcae70a7d741fa61c25c08877e5/header.jpg?t=1759979583","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3962160/382343126/cba168b2dc19347ad5c82a1e087566d3a52ed2fa/1758539648/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758543934","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3962160/382343126/cba168b2dc19347ad5c82a1e087566d3a52ed2fa/1758539648/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758543934","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3962160/382343126/cba168b2dc19347ad5c82a1e087566d3a52ed2fa/1758539648/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758543934","id":257193577,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193577/movie480.mp4?t=1758543934","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193577/